      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>Passes only as the first LiteDB use in the process (e.g. run alone locally): Collation.Default snapshots the culture once per process, so after another test created a database this gets 'de-DE/IgnoreCase' (the culture at first use) instead of 'fi/IgnoreCase'.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
